{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Relaxing and Satisfying &quot;Mow 'Em Up&quot; Monster Survival Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing, satisfying action-survival &quot;mow 'em up&quot;\u2014no fussy tutorials, just jump in and dive into endless monster waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with swarms of weak minions, then face faster, tougher elites as waves ramp up\u2014all at a pace that keeps it fun, not frustrating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? Survive as long as possible. Dodge, weave, and unleash wide-range attacks to clear crowds in an instant. No tedious grinding or gear chaos\u2014every hit lands, every wipeout sparks that &quot;just one more round&quot; thrill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch hordes crumble under your strikes, with flashy effects and popping scores fueling pure, stress-busting joy. Perfect for quick sessions or marathon runs\u2014either way, it\u2019s nonstop, satisfying monster-sweeping fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4140130?t=1762458409","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/82904dad3ad4f2d475f4eb882b77ebade39dfdf1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762458409","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/ba7f97827e509479e1b0f2fcdc9d9bb5c0121a63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762458409","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/ba7f97827e509479e1b0f2fcdc9d9bb5c0121a63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762458409","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Relaxing and Satisfying &quot;Mow 'Em Up&quot; Monster Survival Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing, satisfying action-survival &quot;mow 'em up&quot;\u2014no fussy tutorials, just jump in and dive into endless monster waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with swarms of weak minions, then face faster, tougher elites as waves ramp up\u2014all at a pace that keeps it fun, not frustrating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? Survive as long as possible. Dodge, weave, and unleash wide-range attacks to clear crowds in an instant. No tedious grinding or gear chaos\u2014every hit lands, every wipeout sparks that &quot;just one more round&quot; thrill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch hordes crumble under your strikes, with flashy effects and popping scores fueling pure, stress-busting joy. Perfect for quick sessions or marathon runs\u2014either way, it\u2019s nonstop, satisfying monster-sweeping fun.</p>","developers":["BombGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140130/f16ea536659d9fb3af8e0d1ee4c7084c66d1230e/header.jpg?t=1762458409","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4140130/1723317739/8bb7978742a511b688d3f81794e8a0f3de9d6d43/1761571963/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762458407","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4140130/1723317739/8bb7978742a511b688d3f81794e8a0f3de9d6d43/1761571963/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762458407","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4140130/1723317739/8bb7978742a511b688d3f81794e8a0f3de9d6d43/1761571963/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762458407","id":257223127,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223127/movie480.mp4?t=1762458407","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223127/movie_max.mp4?t=1762458407"},"name":"PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257223127/b3db305589ed848d3f12be236bdf971dd3ba3027/movie_600x337.jpg